's graph at that point. See how we define the derivative using limits, and learn to find derivatives quickly with the very useful power, product, and quotient rules.","duration":null,"grade_levels":[],"id":"9ddf1aa5ed705e308be43982ae5ed122","kind":"topic","learner_needs":[],"learning_activities":[],"lft":11296,"license_description":null,"license_name":null,"license_owner":"","modality":null,"num_coach_contents":0,"on_device_resources":69,"options":{},"parent":"eea3ea7f74d55d08bedc6d1d4778e4c8","resource_types":[],"rght":11459,"sort_order":2.0,"title":"Differentiation: definition and basic derivative rules","tree_id":1,"is_leaf":false,"tags":[],"assessmentmetadata":null,"files":[],"lang":{"id":"en","lang_code":"en","lang_direction":"ltr","lang_name":"English","lang_subcode":null},"thumbnail":null},{"accessibility_labels":[],"admin_imported":false,"ancestors":[{"id":"c9d7f950ab6b5a1199e3d6c10d7f0103","title":"Khan Academy (English - US curriculum)"},{"id":"7dc4264bc90350aab1229487aaa68065","title":"Math"},{"id":"eea3ea7f74d55d08bedc6d1d4778e4c8","title":"AP®︎ Calculus AB"}],"author":"","available":true,"categories":[],"channel_id":"c9d7f950ab6b5a1199e3d6c10d7f0103","coach_content":false,"content_id":"44ecc25cacd455f7a49c3e2fd245428d","description":"The chain rule tells us how to find the derivative of a composite function. This is an exceptionally useful rule, as it opens up a whole world of functions (and equations!) we can now differentiate. Also learn how to use all the different derivative rules together in a thoughtful and strategic manner.","duration":null,"grade_levels":[],"id":"67e05c54840c520d944ac4313db931a7","kind":"topic","learner_needs":[],"learning_activities":[],"lft":11460,"license_description":null,"license_name":null,"license_owner":"","modality":null,"num_coach_contents":0,"on_device_resources":53,"options":{},"parent":"eea3ea7f74d55d08bedc6d1d4778e4c8","resource_types":[],"rght":11587,"sort_order":3.0,"title":"Differentiation: composite, implicit, 